pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Negotiable</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5.0<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">June 18, 1999<br/>Beta 5.0</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20051003133453&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crown_cc3d84.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a crown.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 19.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>A very rare item. There is only one documented crown obtained in Tibia, in Lutabra. \n</p><p>It first appeared when Knightmare (after broadcasting the giveaway) threw this item and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Wand\">Crystal Wand</a> as special rewards into the <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a> temple in Antica in 2000. It was owned by a famous rare collector, Lightbringer, and later sold to an unknown player. It can be seen in the treasure rooms in <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Maze%20of%20Lost%20Souls\">Maze of Lost Souls</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Hellgate\">Hellgate</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Omruc\">Omruc</a>'s pharaoh room in <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a>, in a tomb in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Isle%20of%20the%20Kings\">Isle of the Kings</a>, in the room just south of <a href=\"#/wiki/Bunny%20Bonecrusher\">Bunny Bonecrusher</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Pits%20of%20Inferno\">Pits of Inferno</a> reward room, and inside Morguthis' Treasure Room.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"549baf0f7d092232e7878368aadb2c9c\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:183px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Crownhihi-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:164px; width:185px; top:8.5px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"181\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crownhihi_0cf171.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Crownhihi.png (126 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:183px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Crown_blessed_shield_dragon_scale_legs_magera-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:181px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"181\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crown_blessed_shield_dragon_scale_legs_magera_d5e456.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Crown blessed shield dragon scale legs magera.png (173 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>In November 28, 2019, Rei de Lutabra bought it for around <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Tibia Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tibia_Coins_722cae.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> 168,000 TCs.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/20-years-a-cook-quest\">20 Years a Cook Quest</a></li><li>Blessed Shield</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Wand\">Crystal Wand</a></li><li>Dragon Scale Legs</li><li>Dream Set</li><li>Lightbringer</li><li>Treasure Rooms</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["20-years-a-cook-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"20-years-a-cook-quest","quest":"20 Years a Cook Quest","step":"6-1","n":25,"title":"Usar a máquina","kind":"mention","coords":[]}]}}